{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-model-preset#card-zh","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-model-preset","commit":"2ddd1c3fba1f2b4c1a7f1476a126fce71c9ee276","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-preset 是面向 DSH Web 的模型预设插件，会在对话输入框上方添加模型快捷按钮，并在 Settings → Plugins 中提供预设编辑页。它通过当前会话的模型目录切换 provider、model 和 reasoningEffort 组合；默认提供快速与深度两组方案，用户还可编辑颜色、标签并添加第三组。配置保存到 DSH_HOME 下的 model-preset.json，页面立即更新。适合希望减少模型选择步骤、快速切换模型及思考等级的 Web 用户；需要 Web 模型选择服务和相关界面插槽，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:443-479","client/client.js:269-343","lib/index.js:98-103"]}
{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-model-preset#card-en","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-model-preset","commit":"2ddd1c3fba1f2b4c1a7f1476a126fce71c9ee276","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-preset adds model shortcuts above the DSH Web composer and an editor under Settings → Plugins. Buttons switch the current conversation to a configured provider, model, and optional reasoning effort. Users can edit up to three presets. The host needs model selection and UI slots.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:443-479","client/client.js:269-343","lib/index.js:98-103"]}
