{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-model-preset#feature-1","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-model-preset","commit":"2ddd1c3fba1f2b4c1a7f1476a126fce71c9ee276","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-preset 的功能「会话模型快捷切换」：在普通对话输入框上方显示已配置的按钮。点击后将该会话切换到按钮对应的 provider、model 和可选思考等级；正在进行的模型请求不受影响。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:369-440","client/client.js:462-477"]}
